peptides.</p></fn><fn id="t3-fn3"><label/><p>On day 14, the cultured PBMCs were tested for their reactivity to C1R-A11, -A31, or -A33 cells, which were pre-pulsed with a corresponding peptide or the HIV peptide. The values represent the results of positive wells among four wells, and the background IFN-<italic>&#x003b3;</italic> production in response to the HIV peptide was subtracted. Significant values (<italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.05 by two-tailed Student's <italic>t</italic>-test) are shown in bold.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>